{"data":{"title":"4 Moms","slug":"4-moms","path":"/artists/a-tribe-called-quest/tracks/4-moms/","artwork":"images/artists/a-tribe-called-quest/tracks/4-moms.jpg","artist":{"id":"j7kamL8aLZo","slug":"a-tribe-called-quest","links":null,"title":"A Tribe Called Quest","artwork":null},"id":"Z51SaDSBnv4"},"appearanceCount":2,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"qoj5IS3WuCk","show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"k5TgGkYDGyk","show":{"id":"XGAYE5T-iO0","slug":"252","title":"Soulection Radio Show #252 (Phife Dawg Tribute)","artwork":"/images/episodes/252.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-03-26T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":40674,"platform":"bandcamp","href":"https://djsugai.bandcamp.com/track/a-tribe-called-quest-motivators","artwork":"https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1662935513_7.jpg","last_checked_at":"2018-05-15T13:10:45+00:00","track":"Z51SaDSBnv4"},{"id":40679,"platform":"appleMusic","href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/album/4-moms-feat-spanky/254660972?i=254661185&uo=4","artwork":"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Music32/v4/8e/b1/89/8eb18987-f0f1-d248-7d6